---
description: Data tables must not use card chrome (rounded-* border wrappers)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Table chrome

Never wrap a data table (`Table` from `@/components/ui/table`, or a raw `<table>`) in `rounded-md border` or any `rounded-* border` card. The table sits on the page background.

Scroll the table with `overflow-auto` or `TableInfiniteBody` only.

```tsx
// BAD
<div className="overflow-auto rounded-md border">
  <Table>...</Table>
</div>

// GOOD
<div className="overflow-auto">
  <Table>...</Table>
</div>
```

This rule is about table wrappers only. Alerts, dialogs, and settings field cards may still use `rounded-md border`.
